        "id": "2072071247958253756",
        "text": "Introducing maddie-bench! \n\nmaddie-bench is a benchmark that evaluates how well AI models can “draw” my profile picture (using structured JSON).\n\nBlind pairwise judging (done by a panel consisting of GPT-5.5, Opus-4.8, and Gemini-3.5-flash) calculates Elo.\n\nmaddie-bench is the first installment in my “more weird evals” quest (and I think this one is decently weird).\n\nMore info and full leaderboard at the link below :)",
